---
layout: default
title: Home
---

<section class="py-12 px-8 md:py-20 md:px-12 bg-brown-900 hero bg-[url(/images/hero-cracks.jpg)]">
  <div class="space-y-2 mb-10">
    <h1 class="text-lime-500">Made by hand</h2>
    <h1 class="text-lime-500 ml-0 md:ml-40">No Bullshit</h2>
  </div>
  <h5 class="text-brown-100">Northside Madison. Kilns hot. Shelves full. Come join.</h5>
</section>

<section class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row">
  <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 py-12 md:py-20 px-8 md:px-12">
    <h4 class="text-indigo-600 mb-10">It's not fancy. It's not polished. But it works—and that's the point.</h4>
    <p class="">This is a working ceramic studio on Madison's north side, built inside an old warehouse and 
    shaped by the people who use it.</p>
    <p class="">No pressure to perform. No expectation to be anything other than where you are.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative h-50 md:h-auto">
    <img src="/images/brown-vase.png" class="w-full max-w-[200px] md:max-w-[310px] lg:max-w-[450px] h-auto object-cover absolute right-0 -bottom-5 lg:-bottom-20" />
    <img src="/images/lime-jug.png" class="w-full max-w-[140px] md:max-w-[200px] lg:max-w-[275px] h-auto object-cover absolute right-[160px] md:right-[240px] lg:right-95 -bottom-10 lg:-bottom-30" />
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-12 md:pt-40 md:pb-100 px-8 md:px-12 bg-coal-1100">
  <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-evenly items-center gap-20">
    <div class="w-fit">
      <h2 class="text-lime-500 text-nowrap mb-10 text-center">Classes & Workshops</h2>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 md:justify-items-start gap-6 lg:gap-10">
        <li class="flex flex-row gap-3 items-center justify-center">
          <img src="images/icons/pottery.svg" class="w-10 h-10 md:w-14 md:h-14 object-fit" alt="" /><span class="uppercase text-2xl text-lime-200 tracking-wider">Pottery</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex flex-row gap-3 items-center justify-center">
          <img src="images/icons/sculpture.svg" class="w-10 h-10 md:w-14 md:h-14 object-fit" alt="" /><span class="uppercase text-2xl text-lime-200 tracking-wider">Sculpture</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex flex-row gap-3 items-center justify-center">
          <img src="images/icons/glaze.svg" class="w-10 h-10 md:w-14 md:h-14 object-fit" alt="" /><span class="uppercase text-2xl text-lime-200 tracking-wider">GLAZE-MAKING</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex flex-row gap-3 items-center justify-center">
          <img src="images/icons/mold.svg" class="w-10 h-10 md:w-14 md:h-14 object-fit" alt="" /><span class="uppercase text-2xl text-lime-200 tracking-wider">Mold Making</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="w-full">
      <p class="text-lime-100 mb-4">Never tried pottery before? Has it been awhile since that class you took?  We offer classes at a variety of skill levels.</p>
      <p class="text-lime-100 mb-10">Trying to improve? want to expand your skillset? Sign up to one of our workshops and make it happen! </p>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Peep our classes & Workshops</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="arc-element flex md:flex-row flex-col md:-mt-60">
  <div class="w-full md:max-w-sm rounded-lg">
    <img src="/images/kilnshed-empty.png" class="w-full h-40 md:h-full object-cover bg-center max-h-md" />
  </div>
  <div class="w-full py-12 md:py-20 px-8 md:px-20 bg-coal-0 flex flex-col justify-center">
    <h2 class="text-indigo-600 mb-10">The Shed</h2>
    <h4 class="text-indigo-600 mb-4">Nothing precious. Just a studio that works as hard as you do.</h4>
    <p class="mb-10">It's practical, a little rough, and always evolving. You'll find worktables, wheels, kilns, and shelves packed with pieces in every stage—wet, drying, fired, glazed.</p>

    <h5 class="text-indigo-600 mb-4">Who It Works For</h5>
    <ul class="list-image-[url(/images/icons/indigo-disc.svg)] list-inside space-y-2">
      <li class=""> People who want a consistent place to make, not just visit</li>
      <li class=""> Folks who learn best by doing, not being told</li>
      <li class=""> Makers who want time, space, and access to keep improving</li>
      <li class=""> Anyone looking for a studio that feels usable, not precious</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-12 md:py-20 px-8 md:px-12 bg-brown-950">
  <h2 class="text-brown-600 mb-4 text-center">Membership</h2>
  <h4 class="text-brown-300 mb-10 text-center">A community studio with a variety of memberships to fit your making style and schedule.</h4>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10">

    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between border border-brown-900">
      <div class="p-8 bg-brown-900 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-lime-500 mb-2 text-center">Drop-In Access</h4>
        <p class="text-brown-150 text-center">4 times / month</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="list-image-[url(/images/icons/brown-disc.svg)] list-inside space-y-4 py-12 px-6">
        <li class="text-brown-150"> Drop off & pick up of fired works</li>
        <li class="text-brown-150"> Additional days can be added </li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline brown m-4">Learn More</a>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between border border-brown-900">
      <div class="p-8 bg-brown-900 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-lime-500 mb-2 text-center">Open Studio</h4>
        <p class="text-brown-150 text-center">24 / 7 access</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="list-image-[url(/images/icons/brown-disc.svg)] list-inside space-y-4 py-12 px-6">
        <li class="text-brown-150"> Ample shelf space to store clay, tools & your work</li>
        <li class="text-brown-150"> Access to clay to purchase & studio selected bulk glazes</li>
        <li class="text-brown-150"> Discounts on workshops, classes, material and firing</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline brown m-4">Learn More</a>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between border border-brown-900">
      <div class="p-8 bg-brown-900 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-lime-500 mb-2 text-center">Private Studio</h4>
        <p class="text-brown-150 text-center">24 / 7 access</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="list-image-[url(/images/icons/brown-disc.svg)] list-inside space-y-4 py-12 px-6">
        <li class="text-brown-150"> Multi sized spaces ranging from 6 x 8 to 10 x 12</li>
        <li class="text-brown-150"> Access to clay to purchase & studio selected bulk glazes</li>
        <li class="text-brown-150"> Discounts on workshops, classes, material and firing</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline brown m-4">Learn More</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-brown-150 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-10">
  
    <div class="py-20 px-12">
      <h2 class="text-brown-700 mb-4">The Kilns</h2>
      <h4 class="text-brown-700 mb-6">Need to fire pots?</h4>
      <p class="">We got you covered! Everything from low fire, to high fire gas!</p>
      <a href="btn btn-outline brown">Learn More</a>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col xl:flex-row items-center justify-center">
      <div class="p-8 bg-coal-0/50 backdrop-blur-sm w-full xl:w-fit text-center h-fit">
        <div class="flex flex-row mb-4 gap-4 justify-center">
          <img src="/images/icons/kiln1.svg" class="w-10 h-10 object-fit" alt="" />
          <img src="/images/icons/kiln2.svg" class="w-10 h-10 object-fit" alt="" />
        </div>
        <p class="mb-4">Have your own electric kiln? </br> Need repair?</p>
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold mb-2">Call James today!</p>
        <a href="tel:<%= site.data.site_metadata.phone %>"><%= site.data.site_metadata.phone %></a>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/kiln.jpg" class="ml-0 xl:-ml-8 w-full xl:max-w-sm h-auto object-cover" />
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-20 px-12 bg-lime-300 border-b-10 border-lime-500">
  <h2 class="text-lime-800 mb-4">CANT WAIT? CONTACT US TODAY!</h2>
  <p class="mb-6">Subscribe to our email list to be the first to know about classes, workshops, firings & more!</p>
  <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Learn More</a>
</section>